#: processes/sdlc/test-data-curation.bpmn:108
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "BOUND BY THE CONTENT TYPE (`contentType` and `specialisation` in `schemas/test-data.ts`), so no single content-type `calledElement` is hardcoded here: the activity names `test-data-sets`, and each content-type adapter supplies its own specialisation subprocess. `fhir-templating` (`FHIR_TEMPLATING_SPECIALISATION`) is one named specialisation for FHIR IG / DAK content (MeasureReport cohorts, questionnaire responses, bundle templates) — named as such, not the platform design; document folios (`markdown-fixture`), proof folios (`lean-counterexample`), and tabular cohorts (`tabular-cohort`) supply their own."
msgstr ""

#: processes/sdlc/test-data-curation.bpmn:92
