msgid "Calls `Process_SmeTestDataReview` (`processes/sdlc/sme-test-data-review.bpmn`) so a human SME in a `judgementOnly` lane reviews each worked case (`decision-support`) or cohort plus expected value (`indicator-definition`) and records an attributable `sme-case-verdict/1.0.0` node."
msgstr ""

